    "body": "My preference would be to have compile-time consts in the start of the function to avoid having magic constants here, so:\r\n\r\n```\r\nconst ESCAPE_BEGIN : char = '\\u{1b}';\r\nconst MAYBE_ESCAPE_END : char = 'm';\r\n```\r\nat the top of the function and then matching on `ESCAPE_BEGIN` and `MAYBE_ESCAPE_END` in the code. (Again, pick names that make sense to you).",
